Package: marine-lume
Version: 0.12.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: DeepBlue Dynamics <kord@deepbluedynamics.com>
Depends: marine-signalk-server-container
Description: Records Signal K history on the Pi and lets you query it with SQL or plain-English questions.
 Records Signal K history on the Pi and lets you query it with SQL or
 plain-English questions. It integrates directly with the HaLOS Marine
 Signal K server container, capturing navigation, engine, and environmental
 data into 10-second bucket aggregates with minimal CPU and memory footprint
 on Raspberry Pi 5.
